---
const missions=[
 {id:'m1',title:'1 · Relocate the signal panel',brief:'Move the triangular signal panel to the marked bay. One translation can solve it.',min:1,start:[[-6,-4],[-3,-4],[-5,-1]],target:[[1,-9],[4,-9],[2,-6]],hint:'Compare one corresponding vertex in the start and target. The same slide must work for every vertex.'},
 {id:'m2',title:'2 · Mirror the wayfinding sign',brief:'Reposition the sign across the building centre line. More than one valid transformation sequence can reach the target.',min:1,start:[[-6,1],[-3,1],[-4,4]],target:[[6,1],[3,1],[4,4]],hint:'A reflection in the y-axis is shortest. A longer valid route also exists.'},
 {id:'m3',title:'3 · Repair the two-step mural',brief:'The mural needs two successive transformations. Track each corresponding vertex through A → A′ → A″.',min:2,start:[[2,2],[5,2],[4,4]],target:[[-4,5],[-1,5],[-2,3]],hint:'One route is reflect in the x-axis, then translate 6 left and 7 up. Try to find the alternate two-step order too.'}
];
---
<div class="arcade" data-unit1-arcade data-missions={JSON.stringify(missions)}>
 <header><div><p class="eyebrow">MATH ARCADE · COORDINATE RESCUE</p><h2>Restore the Festival Grid</h2><p>A storm scrambled the coordinate blueprint. Restore three design panels, then compare emergency routes. Accuracy and efficient mathematical choices earn points; speed does not.</p></div><div class="score" aria-live="polite"><span>Total score</span><strong data-total>0</strong><small>/ 400</small></div></header>
 <div class="game-layout"><div class="board-wrap"><svg class="board" data-board viewBox="0 0 520 520" role="img" aria-label="Coordinate plane for the current Festival Grid mission."><rect x="40" y="40" width="440" height="440" rx="12"/><g class="grid" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:21},(_,i)=>40+i*22).map(p=><><line x1={p} y1="40" x2={p} y2="480"/><line x1="40" y1={p} x2="480" y2={p}/></>)}</g><g class="axes" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="40" y1="260" x2="480" y2="260"/><line x1="260" y1="40" x2="260" y2="480"/></g><g data-target-shape class="target-shape"></g><g data-current-shape class="current-shape"></g><g data-route-layer class="route-layer"></g></svg><p class="board-transcript" data-transcript>Mission 1 start and target are shown on the coordinate plane.</p></div>
 <div class="mission-panel"><div class="mission-head"><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT MISSION</p><h3 data-title></h3><p data-brief></p></div><div class="coords"><strong>Corresponding vertices</strong><div data-coords></div></div><div class="history"><strong>Transformation history</strong><ol data-history><li>Original image: A, B, C</li></ol></div>
 <div class="controls" data-transform-controls><fieldset><legend>Translation</legend><label>Horizontal change<input data-dx type="number" min="-10" max="10" value="0" inputmode="numeric"/></label><label>Vertical change<input data-dy type="number" min="-10" max="10" value="0" inputmode="numeric"/></label><button type="button" data-translate>Apply translation</button></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Reflection</legend><button type="button" data-reflect-x>Reflect in x-axis</button><button type="button" data-reflect-y>Reflect in y-axis</button></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Rotation about the origin</legend><button type="button" data-rot-cw>90° clockwise</button><button type="button" data-rot-ccw>90° counterclockwise</button><button type="button" data-rot-180>180°</button></fieldset></div>
 <div class="mission-actions"><button type="button" class="verify" data-verify>Verify position</button><button type="button" class="secondary" data-reset>Reset mission</button><details><summary>Need a hint?</summary><p data-hint></p></details><p class="status" data-status role="status" tabindex="-1">Mission ready.</p></div></div></div>
 <section class="route-mission locked" data-route-mission aria-disabled="true"><div><p class="eyebrow">FINAL MISSION</p><h3>4 · Dispatch through the grid</h3><p>Every route starts at A(−5, 4) and finishes at F(4, −3). Run at least two routes. Compare net movement with horizontal and vertical distance travelled, then certify one efficient route.</p></div><div class="route-buttons"><button type="button" data-route="A" disabled>Route A · horizontal then vertical</button><button type="button" data-route="B" disabled>Route B · backtrack detour</button><button type="button" data-route="C" disabled>Route C · vertical then horizontal</button></div><div class="route-evidence" data-route-evidence><p>Run a route to reveal its evidence.</p></div><button type="button" data-route-verify disabled>Certify an efficient route</button><p data-route-status role="status" tabindex="-1">Complete the three design missions first.</p></section>
 <footer><div><strong>Completion rule</strong><p>Restore all three panels and certify an efficient route after comparing at least two routes.</p></div><button type="button" class="replay" data-replay>Replay the full arcade</button><p data-finish role="status" tabindex="-1">0 of 4 missions complete.</p></footer>
</div>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-unit1-arcade]').forEach(root=>{const missions=JSON.parse(root.dataset.missions||'[]'),board=root.querySelector<SVGSVGElement>('[data-board]')!,currentLayer=root.querySelector<SVGGElement>('[data-current-shape]')!,targetLayer=root.querySelector<SVGGElement>('[data-target-shape]')!,routeLayer=root.querySelector<SVGGElement>('[data-route-layer]')!,transcript=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-transcript]')!,title=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-title]')!,brief=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-brief]')!,coords=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-coords]')!,history=root.querySelector<HTMLOListElement>('[data-history]')!,status=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-status]')!,total=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-total]')!,finish=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-finish]')!;let index=0,current:number[][]=[],moves:string[]=[],missionScore=100,scores=[0,0,0,0],complete=new Set<number>(),selectedRoute='',tried=new Set<string>();
 const px=(n:number)=>260+n*22,py=(n:number)=>260-n*22,fmt=(p:number[])=>`(${p[0]}, ${p[1]})`.replaceAll('-','−');const label=(i:number)=>String.fromCharCode(65+i);const prime=(n:number)=>n===0?'':n===1?'′':'″';
 const polygon=(pts:number[][],kind:string)=>{const line=pts.map(p=>`${px(p[0])},${py(p[1])}`).join(' ');return`<polygon points="${line}"/><g>${pts.map((p,i)=>`<circle cx="${px(p[0])}" cy="${py(p[1])}" r="8"/><text x="${px(p[0])+12}" y="${py(p[1])-12}">${label(i)}${kind==='current'?prime(Math.min(moves.length,2)):kind==='target'?'★':''}</text>`).join('')}</g>`};
 const same=(a:number[][],b:number[][])=>a.length===b.length&&a.every((p,i)=>p[0]===b[i][0]&&p[1]===b[i][1]);const updateTotal=()=>{const sum=scores.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);total.textContent=String(sum);finish.textContent=`${complete.size} of 4 missions complete. ${complete.size===4?`Final score ${sum}/400. Festival Grid restored.`:''}`};
 const draw=()=>{const m=missions[index];targetLayer.innerHTML=polygon(m.target,'target');currentLayer.innerHTML=polygon(current,'current');routeLayer.innerHTML='';coords.innerHTML=current.map((p,i)=>`<span><b>${label(i)}${prime(Math.min(moves.length,2))}</b> ${fmt(p)}</span>`).join('');transcript.textContent=`${m.title}. Current vertices: ${current.map((p,i)=>`${label(i)}${prime(Math.min(moves.length,2))} ${fmt(p)}`).join('; ')}. Target vertices: ${m.target.map((p:any,i:number)=>`${label(i)} target ${fmt(p)}`).join('; ')}.`};
 const load=(i:number)=>{index=i;const m=missions[i];current=m.start.map((p:number[])=>[...p]);moves=[];missionScore=100;title.textContent=m.title;brief.textContent=m.brief;root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-hint]')!.textContent=m.hint;history.innerHTML='<li>Original image: A, B, C</li>';status.textContent='Mission ready. Use the coordinate evidence, then verify the final image.';draw()};
 const apply=(name:string,fn:(p:number[])=>number[])=>{if(complete.has(index))return;current=current.map(fn);moves.push(name);if(moves.length>missions[index].min)missionScore=Math.max(60,missionScore-10);history.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<li>${moves.length===1?'A → A′':moves.length===2?'A′ → A″':'Extra move'}: ${name}</li>`);draw();status.textContent=`Applied ${name}. Compare each corresponding vertex with the target.`};
 root.querySelector('[data-translate]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const dx=Number(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-dx]')!.value),dy=Number(root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-dy]')!.value);if(!Number.isInteger(dx)||!Number.isInteger(dy)||Math.abs(dx)>10||Math.abs(dy)>10){status.textContent='Use whole-number horizontal and vertical changes from −10 to 10.';return}if(dx===0&&dy===0){status.textContent='A translation must move the image. Enter a non-zero horizontal or vertical change.';return}apply(`translate ${Math.abs(dx)} ${dx>=0?'right':'left'}, ${Math.abs(dy)} ${dy>=0?'up':'down'}`,p=>[p[0]+dx,p[1]+dy])});root.querySelector('[data-reflect-x]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>apply('reflect in the x-axis',p=>[p[0],-p[1]]));root.querySelector('[data-reflect-y]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>apply('reflect in the y-axis',p=>[-p[0],p[1]]));root.querySelector('[data-rot-cw]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>apply('rotate 90° clockwise about the origin',p=>[p[1],-p[0]]));root.querySelector('[data-rot-ccw]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>apply('rotate 90° counterclockwise about the origin',p=>[-p[1],p[0]]));root.querySelector('[data-rot-180]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>apply('rotate 180° about the origin',p=>[-p[0],-p[1]]));
 root.querySelector('[data-reset]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>load(index));root.querySelector('[data-verify]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const m=missions[index];if(!same(current,m.target)){missionScore=Math.max(60,missionScore-8);status.textContent='Not at the target yet. Match A with A, B with B, and C with C; inspect both x- and y-coordinates.';status.focus({preventScroll:true});return}if(!moves.length){status.textContent='The target must be reached through a transformation, not by skipping the mission.';return}scores[index]=missionScore;complete.add(index);status.textContent=`Mission verified for ${missionScore}/100. ${moves.length===m.min?'Efficient route achieved.':'Valid route achieved; extra moves reduced only the efficiency score.'}`;updateTotal();if(index<missions.length-1){setTimeout(()=>load(index+1),250)}else unlockRoutes()});
 const routes:any={A:{pts:[[-5,4],[4,4],[4,-3]],h:9,v:7,efficient:true},B:{pts:[[-5,4],[7,4],[1,4],[4,4],[4,-3]],h:21,v:7,efficient:false},C:{pts:[[-5,4],[-5,-3],[4,-3]],h:9,v:7,efficient:true}};const routeSection=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-route-mission]')!,routeEvidence=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-route-evidence]')!,routeStatus=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-route-status]')!;function unlockRoutes(){routeSection.classList.remove('locked');routeSection.setAttribute('aria-disabled','false');routeSection.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=false);routeStatus.textContent='Routes unlocked. Run at least two different routes.'}
 routeSection.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-route]').forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{const key=btn.dataset.route||'',r=routes[key];selectedRoute=key;tried.add(key);routeLayer.innerHTML=`<polyline points="${r.pts.map((p:number[])=>`${px(p[0])},${py(p[1])}`).join(' ')}"/><circle cx="${px(-5)}" cy="${py(4)}" r="9"/><circle class="finish-point" cx="${px(4)}" cy="${py(-3)}" r="9"/>`;targetLayer.innerHTML='';currentLayer.innerHTML='';transcript.textContent=`Route ${key} from A(−5, 4) to F(4, −3). Net change is 9 right and 7 down. Horizontal distance travelled ${r.h}; vertical distance travelled ${r.v}.`;routeEvidence.innerHTML=`<strong>Route ${key}</strong><div><span>Net horizontal <b>9 right</b></span><span>Net vertical <b>7 down</b></span><span>Horizontal distance travelled <b>${r.h}</b></span><span>Vertical distance travelled <b>${r.v}</b></span></div><p>${r.efficient?'This route reaches the finish without horizontal backtracking.':'This route still reaches the same finish, but horizontal backtracking increases distance travelled.'}</p>`;routeStatus.textContent=`Route ${key} recorded. ${tried.size} different route${tried.size===1?'':'s'} tried.`}));root.querySelector('[data-route-verify]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(tried.size<2){routeStatus.textContent='Run at least two different routes before certifying one.';routeStatus.focus({preventScroll:true});return}if(!selectedRoute){routeStatus.textContent='Select the route you want to certify.';return}const r=routes[selectedRoute];scores[3]=r.efficient?100:75;complete.add(3);routeStatus.textContent=r.efficient?`Route ${selectedRoute} certified for 100/100: same final position, minimum horizontal and vertical travel.`:`Route ${selectedRoute} is valid but inefficient. It earns 75/100 because backtracking increases travel distance.`;updateTotal();finish.focus({preventScroll:true})});
 root.querySelector('[data-replay]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{scores=[0,0,0,0];complete.clear();tried.clear();selectedRoute='';routeSection.classList.add('locked');routeSection.setAttribute('aria-disabled','true');routeSection.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button').forEach(b=>b.disabled=true);routeEvidence.innerHTML='<p>Run a route to reveal its evidence.</p>';routeStatus.textContent='Complete the three design missions first.';updateTotal();load(0);title.focus?.()});load(0);updateTotal();
});
</script>
<style>
.arcade{overflow:hidden;border-radius:20px;background:#0f213d;color:#fff}.arcade>header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:1rem;padding:1.2rem;background:#173f70}.arcade h2,.arcade h3{margin:.15rem 0}.eyebrow{margin:0;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.09em;color:#bfe2ff}.score{display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:110px;padding:.7rem;border-radius:14px;background:#0c294d}.score strong{font-size:2rem}.score small{color:#cfe2f6}.game-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(360px,1.05fr) minmax(320px,.95fr);gap:1rem;padding:1rem}.board-wrap,.mission-panel{min-width:0}.board{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;background:#f8fbff;border-radius:14px}.board>rect{fill:#f8fbff;stroke:#91aac5;stroke-width:2}.grid{stroke:#dce6f2;stroke-width:1}.axes{stroke:#1d3557;stroke-width:3}.target-shape polygon{fill:#d8f5e5;stroke:#2b6e3f;stroke-width:4;stroke-dasharray:8 5}.target-shape circle{fill:#fff;stroke:#2b6e3f;stroke-width:3}.current-shape polygon{fill:#dbeafe;stroke:#2457c5;stroke-width:5}.current-shape circle{fill:#ffedb0;stroke:#b76e00;stroke-width:3}.board text{fill:#16365f;font:900 17px system-ui}.route-layer polyline{fill:none;stroke:#b76e00;stroke-width:6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.route-layer circle{fill:#dbeafe;stroke:#2457c5;stroke-width:4}.route-layer .finish-point{fill:#ffedb0;stroke:#b76e00}.board-transcript{margin:.55rem 0;padding:.65rem;border-radius:10px;background:#eaf3ff;color:#17314f;font-weight:700}.mission-panel{display:grid;gap:.7rem}.mission-head,.coords,.history,.mission-actions,.controls fieldset{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid #45698f;border-radius:12px;background:#172e4e}.coords div{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.45rem}.coords span{padding:.4rem;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:#17314f}.history ol{margin:.45rem 0 0;padding-left:1.25rem}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.65rem}.controls fieldset{min-width:0;margin:0}.controls fieldset:first-child{grid-row:span 2}.controls legend{font-weight:850}.controls label{display:grid;gap:.2rem;margin:.35rem 0}.controls input{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:.55rem;font:inherit}.arcade button{min-height:44px;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:.6rem .75rem;background:#64e2bf;color:#0b2930;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.controls button{width:100%;margin:.25rem 0}.mission-actions{display:grid;gap:.55rem}.mission-actions .secondary,.replay{background:#fff;color:#173f70}.status{margin:0;padding:.65rem;border-radius:9px;background:#0d2746}.route-mission{margin:0 1rem 1rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #45698f;border-radius:14px;background:#172e4e}.route-mission.locked{opacity:.58}.route-buttons{display:flex;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:.75rem 0}.route-evidence{padding:.75rem;border-radius:10px;background:#eaf3ff;color:#17314f}.route-evidence div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.45rem}.route-evidence span{padding:.45rem;border-radius:7px;background:#fff}.route-mission [data-route-status]{padding:.65rem;border-radius:9px;background:#0d2746}.arcade footer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:1rem;align-items:center;padding:1rem;background:#0b1b31}.arcade footer p{margin:.25rem 0}.arcade footer [data-finish]{grid-column:1/-1;padding:.7rem;border-radius:10px;background:#173f70}.arcade :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd75e;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:900px){.game-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.board{max-width:650px;margin:auto}}@media(max-width:620px){.arcade>header,.arcade footer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.score{justify-self:start}.controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}.controls fieldset:first-child{grid-row:auto}.route-evidence div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:390px){.game-layout,.route-mission{padding:.7rem;margin:.7rem}.mission-head,.coords,.history,.mission-actions,.controls fieldset{padding:.65rem}.board-transcript,.route-evidence{overflow-wrap:anywhere}}@media(max-width:320px){.game-layout{padding:.5rem}.route-buttons{display:grid}.route-buttons button{width:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.arcade *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
